    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.1 [Ld]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAs">I As</ref> 4.1 [Ld]</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Se godcunde lare us gemynað, þæt we ða heofonlica ðinga mid ðam eorþlicum ⁊ ða ecelic mid ðam hwilwendlicum geearniaþ.] [Ld]</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">For the divine teaching instructs us that we gain the things of heaven by those of the earth, and the eternal by the temporal.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in G, D]</ab>
      </div>
